{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15203270","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15203270","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1520327001:0":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, apologies for my delay.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1AA02ADF23326839","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, apologies for my delay.","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, apologies for my delay.","variant_male_record_index":"185640","variant_female_record_index":"185641","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520327002:1":{"text":"Age is catching up with me. I'd hoped to reach you before the hornleaf bears did, to drive them off myself.","source_cn":"果然是年纪大了……我原本还以为能赶在那些叶角熊之前过来...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3768CA11A0416CB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Age is catching up with me. I'd hoped to reach you before the hornleaf bears did, to drive them off myself.","female":"Age is catching up with me. I'd hoped to reach you before the hornleaf bears did, to drive them off myself.","variant_male_record_index":"185642","variant_female_record_index":"185643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1520327002":{"text":"Age is catching up with me. I'd hoped to reach you before the hornleaf bears did, to drive them off myself.","source_cn":"果然是年纪大了……我原本还以为能赶在那些叶角熊之前过来，替您驱赶它们。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3768CA11A0416CB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Age is catching up with me. I'd hoped to reach you before the hornleaf bears did, to drive them off myself.","female":"Age is catching up with me. I'd hoped to reach you before the hornleaf bears did, to drive them off myself.","variant_male_record_index":"185642","variant_female_record_index":"185643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520327003:1":{"text":"Hehe... Let's just call it my secret technique.","source_cn":"呵呵……这是我秘不传人的诀窍。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1B089C3A448004","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hehe... Let's just call it my secret technique.","female":"Hehe... Let's just call it my secret technique.","variant_male_record_index":"185644","variant_female_record_index":"185645","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520327004:1":{"text":"Frui, do you know why the Wildborn build their homes in the trees?","source_cn":"果，你知道为何雅库伯尔人执着于将房屋建在树上吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C8B5E297E04F16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520327005:1":{"text":"Uh... for the view? I mean, the view is pretty good!","source_cn":"呃……为了看风景？这上面的风景不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD49F73A2FAC6B1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520327006:0":{"text":"Be serious!","source_cn":"……你给我认真一点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA7A6D600080C737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520327007:0":{"text":"Oh, uh... So we don't get caught after stealing leaves from hornleaf bears?","source_cn":"啊？那……那难道是为了偷叶子的时候不被叶角熊追上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC28E59FA26DAF0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520327008:0":{"text":"Shortsighted!","source_cn":"狭隘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EBF52ACBE1BE058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1520327009:0":{"text":"We build our homes high to stay out of reach of wild beasts, and to gain the high ground when we do have to fight!","source_cn":"把房屋建在高处，是为了躲避野兽的侵袭，还能帮我们在与野...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA759ED21A9F9254D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520327010:0":{"text":"That's why, in Wildborn tradition, you're not considered an adult until you've built your own treehouse.","source_cn":"也是因此，雅库伯尔才会有“建造树屋后才算正式成年”的习俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x637D7777D430677D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520327011:0":{"text":"It's not just for you youngsters. Every Wildborn relies on the trees to survive. Understand?","source_cn":"不仅是你们这些刚成年的孩子们，每一个雅库伯尔人都要依靠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF22EEBEDA4DAD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520327012:1":{"text":"I see! I get it now!","source_cn":"原来是这样！我现在明白了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB30F5EA4BF29FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1520327013:0":{"text":"Sigh... Kids these days. They're too scared to even climb a tree. I just don't get it.","source_cn":"唉……真是搞不明白，为什么新一代的孩子里，胆小的越来越...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE71FBE287C6F966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1520327014:1":{"text":"Alright, Frui. Come down already. This isn't a sightseeing trip.","source_cn":"好了。果，快点下来，别在上面看风景了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD54837A1D15BFC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1520327015:1":{"text":"Huh? You mean... climb down?!","source_cn":"啊？下去？还要下去吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72954D7932367703","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1520327016:1":{"text":"What, you planning to live up there? Down. Now!","source_cn":"难不成你要在上面呆一辈子？快点下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1C1D8B123D6792C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1520327017:1":{"text":"I... I...","source_cn":"我……我……<key:dialog56>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81E3021E20FF0547","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1520327018:0":{"text":"I can't! I'm still scared!!","source_cn":"……我不敢啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B648052F7FCC6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1520327019:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog117>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A1F9517B600F1F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1520327020:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog118>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x540DAE2BFBC19700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1520327021:0":{"text":"Then stay up there!","source_cn":"……那你就在上面待着吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B6403C65AA7AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1520327022:0":{"text":"W-wait! Toro, don't go! Toro, come back! Help!! HEEELP!!","source_cn":"哎哎哎！都罗，你别走啊！都罗——！救命——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FD2C699FBE3D159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"So it was your plan all along.","source_cn":"果然是你的主意","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC68FE95C3E27E7DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So it was your plan all along.","female":"So it was your plan all along.","variant_male_record_index":"78715","variant_female_record_index":"78716","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"So this is what you wanted me to see?","source_cn":"这就是你说的有趣的事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF9DDEB3F81CBFD76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So this is what you wanted me to see?","female":"So this is what you wanted me to see?","variant_male_record_index":"78717","variant_female_record_index":"78718","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:逐影营地长老都罗":{"text":"Elder Toro","source":"逐影营地长老都罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:果":{"text":"Frui","source":"果","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":3}}